{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zGLQBWGOPKA2iB8J6L1IJQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:03.730383+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zGLQBWGOPKA2iB8J6L1IJQ","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/GRVTXR5nCFX5wHZOkY2vDic8MaJLraOpMPd1bdpl7r9bfrZhqiclMyBdeicdFoF7Ot4PxsX1HYTnY4Xsye72tLibKw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，志愿投身国家建设事业，道德品行端正，自觉遵纪守法，并同时符合下列条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.在目前就读学校有机会取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生（含天津大学本校生）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><table><tbody><tr><th><span><span>专业代码</span></span></th><th><span><span>专业名称</span></span></th><th><span><span>研究方向代码</span></span></th><th><span><span>研究方向名称</span></span></th></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>080800</span></span></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>电气工程</span></span></td><td><span><span>01</span></span></td><td><span><span>电气控制</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>02</span></span></td><td><span><span>电力系统和高电压</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>081000</span></span></td><td><span><span>信息与通信工程</span></span></td><td><span><span>00</span></span></td><td><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>081100</span></span></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>控制科学与工程</span></span></td><td><span><span>01</span></span></td><td><span><span>控制理论与控制工程</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>02</span></span></td><td><span><span>检测技术与智能系统</span></span></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><span><span>085400</span></span></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><span><span>电子信息（专业学位）</span></span></td><td><span><span>01</span></span></td><td><span><span>控制理论与控制工程</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>02</span></span></td><td><span><span>检测技术与智能系统</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>03</span></span></td><td><span><span>信息与通信工程</span></span></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>085801</span></span></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><span><span>电气工程（专业学位）</span></span></td><td><span><span>01</span></span></td><td><span><span>电气控制</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>02</span></span></td><td><span><span>电力系统和高电压</span></span></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"8\"><span><span>089906</span></span></td><td rowspan=\"8\"><span><span>低空技术与工程</span></span></td><td><span><span>01</span></span></td><td><span><span>控制科学与工程</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>02</span></span></td><td><span><span>电气工程</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>03</span></span></td><td><span><span>信息与通信工程</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>04</span></span></td><td><span><span>力学</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>05</span></span></td><td><span><span>建筑学</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>06</span></span></td><td><span><span>海洋科学</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>07</span></span></td><td><span><span>管理科学与工程</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>08</span></span></td><td><span><span>智能科学与技术</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><section><section><section><section><strong><span>3</span></strong></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>天津大学硕士研究生招生推免系统仅为天津大学接收硕士推免生的辅助系统，用于前期报名登记、信息采集。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.申请人在我校规定时间内，按要求填写本人各项真实信息，学院会根据申请时间分批收集、审核考生信息。</span></span></p><p><span><span>系统开放时间：7月7日12点-9月10日24点</span></span></p><p><span><span>集中审核时间：第一批次8月21日，第二批次9月11日</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.申请人还需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节，完成最终录取，具体网址和系统开放时间等内容后续将在天津大学研究生招生网（http://yzb.tju.edu.cn）另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学院将会根据申请人报名情况收集信息，依据相关政策分批次开展考核选拔工作。相关考核安排详见电气自动化与信息工程学院相关通知，可随时关注学院网站或天大推免系统。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 考生相关纸质证明材料可扫描后上传系统（如系统遇到问题，请添加天大技术问题反馈QQ群，搜索群号“314310314”）。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><strong><span>4</span></strong></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>1.申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。对在推免过程中存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，或存在其他严重影响推免过程和结果公平公正行为的，一经查实，取消我校免试读研资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.我校将在录取当年5-6月对所有拟录取的推免生进行资格复审。通过资格复审后，方可被正式录取，我校予以发放录取通知书。未通过资格复审者，取消其研究生录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本通知内容与教育主管部门下达文件不符的，以教育主管部门下达的文件为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.导师信息请查阅电气自动化与信息工程学院官网相关介绍（师资队伍-https://seea.tju.edu.cn/szdw.htm）。建议申请人需事先与学院（本人所申请专业及方向）的导师联系，并在报考系统中填写导师姓名。</span></span></p><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/GRVTXR5nCFWibEibVkSRoXiczUuibJx8BIsZuNmCdoXO5giaibIu8RDuicNxj4AxdszKa9iaTw7zI4BNpX6SgnXPZbSakA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=5\" title=\"动态黑色音符\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>往</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>期</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>推</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>荐</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3NDUwMjk3MA==&amp;mid=2247520243&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2a695294722c8f86eca92a439f38b1c6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">暑假，来天大探索人工智能！面向中学生，2026天津大学AI探索者科创营报名中</a></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3NDUwMjk3MA==&amp;mid=2247520311&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5a5e087dd4b53736a96fbb9a4f5676f7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">祝贺！吴建中校友出任巴斯大学副校长（科研）</a></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3NDUwMjk3MA==&amp;mid=2247520298&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0e57f8a86d1343233da087e7854efcaf&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">把天大拍成一部科普片｜走进电气自动化与信息工程学院，解码未来“智慧”！</a></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3NDUwMjk3MA==&amp;mid=2247520293&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4400477e25ec11f969c06d33a2f74ea7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">关于表彰学院优秀共产党员、优秀党务工作者和先进党支部的决定</a></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>//</span></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><span>❤SEIE❤</span></span></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span><span>供稿 | 赵雅静</span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span><span><span>编辑 | 吴润华</span></span